    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d446">

                <pb facs="0540" n="1294" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v02/pg1294"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111Sp1/79</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Seville</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gracey</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Seville</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-17T12:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 17, 1917, noon</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received 11.55 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Consular agent, Cadiz, reports German submarine <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >U–293</hi> which entered Cadiz September 9, 7 a.m., will be interned;
                    wireless has been removed, munitions unloaded, officer on parole, members are
                    going to San Fernando; damage was broken propeller shaft.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gracey</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
